      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "another vrc_trigger action that would also be helpful would be the { AudioSource.Stop } ( https://docs.unity3d.com/ScriptReference/AudioSource.Stop.html ) while all of these methods will probably be accessible when playmaker comes out. it would be useful to have these actions available until then or for people that wont be able to get playmaker.",
