      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is an old canny post, but i've been needing/wanting this for avatars as well even before this was posted.  I can see issues with too many sounds played simultaneously causing extreme loudness or audio breaking, but this could be limited or implemented into the ducking system.\nThis is a must have for high quality audio systems.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
